PREAMBLE
==============================================================================

VisionForge Studio ("the Software") is an industrial-grade computer vision suite 
designed for video forensic tracking, dataset curation, and headless deep learning 
training.

This license is designed to empower the global computer vision, AI, and academic 
research community to study, test, benchmark, and advance computer vision for free, 
while strictly protecting the author's proprietary source code against unauthorized 
commercial exploitation, competitive cloning, code theft, and rebranding.

